穩定醬油拉麵，加一點油脂口感。\n細麵選了偏硬，吃起來還是偏軟，稍微失望。偏瘦的叉燒需要咀嚼一下但不至於太硬。溏心蛋和筍干都是還OK不踩雷的味道。\n整體來說中規中矩的不錯吃，但也沒什麼特別亮點，就是連鎖醬油拉麵的水準，我給4.0分，桌上的柚子醋和蒜泥可以加一點轉味。\n\n#Lev",null,[0,169]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/940407899973957305/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTVjJKNldtNWlibXh2WVRKS1UyUnVTa1ZOVm5CMldXNVJlVlpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/940407899973957305/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTVjJKNldtNWlibXh2WVRKS1UyUnVTa1ZOVm5CMldXNVJlVlpYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/940407899973957305/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTVjJKNldtNWlibXh2WVRKS1UyUnVTa1ZOVm5CMldXNVJlVlpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/940407899973957305/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTVjJKNldtNWlibXh2WVRKS1UyUnVTa1ZOVm5CMldXNVJlVlpYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/940407899973957305/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTVjJKNldtNWlibXh2WVRKS1UyUnVTa1ZOVm5CMldXNVJlVlpYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/940407899973957305/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRTVjJKNldtNWlibXh2WVRKS1UyUnVTa1ZOVm5CMldXNVJlVlpYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,5042,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSV2J6Wm5ibmxvYTJKU2RuSkVNVnB2WW5ReVZXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb1fcc3305692ab5f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkRWbzZnbnloa2JSdnJEMVpvYnQyVWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSV2J6Wm5ibmxvYTJKU2RuSkVNVnB2WW5ReVZXYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSV2J6Wm5ibmxvYTJKU2RuSkVNVnB2WW5ReVZXYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSV2J6Wm5ibmxvYTJKU2RuSkVNVnB2WW5ReVZXYxILMGVCZEV3NFVkdGMaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rUldielpuYm5sb2EySlNkbkpFTVZwdlluUXlWV2MSCzBlQmRFdzRVZHRjIhIJAAAAAAAA